Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 05:56:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Reto 4 (bonus): cambia el icono de ajustes de la barra
 superior
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Icons.settings pasa a Icons.tune. El botón sigue abriendo Ajustes y el
cambio se ve con un hot reload.
---
 lib/presentation/bottom_navigation/bottom_navigation_page.dart | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/lib/presentation/bottom_navigation/bottom_navigation_page.dart b/lib/presentation/bottom_navigation/bottom_navigation_page.dart
index 65f04d6..15d5b9f 100644
--- a/lib/presentation/bottom_navigation/bottom_navigation_page.dart
+++ b/lib/presentation/bottom_navigation/bottom_navigation_page.dart
@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@ class BottomNavigationPage extends StatelessWidget {
             onPressed: () {
               const SettingsRoute().push(context);
             },
-            icon: const Icon(Icons.settings),
+            icon: const Icon(Icons.tune),
           ),
         ],
       ),
